            "paragraph": "When the LPJ (Lund-Potsdam-Jena; Sitch et al., 2003) DGVM was expanded by agricultural activities, forming LPJmL (Lund-Potsdam-Jena managed Land; Bondeau et al., 2007), this extension included the integration of managed grassland.",
