            "target_entity_type": "Source",
            "paragraph": "LPJmL simulates carbon and water cycles as well as vegetation growth dynamics depending on daily weather conditions and soil texture. We refer to the current status of the model prior to the implementation of managed grasslands as LPJmL 3.5. Simulations in this study are conducted on a regular grid at 0.5\u00b0 \u00d7 0.5\u00b0, but as the model is essentially a point model, it can be run at any spatial resolution provided by the input data.",
